      "statusChangeID": "6610ba80288ad49402271ca7",
      "statusChangeNewStatus": "tracked",
      "value": "The audit log already holds far too much data for us to retain forever, and the retention period is currently set at 6 months. Now that we've had Groups out in the wild long enough to build some projections, we can maybe reconsider raising that retention period, but I wouldn't expect us to ever go past a year, 2 at most.\n\nThat said, storing some information on the membership itself about who accepted the user to the group may be possible, but we wouldn't be able to backfill that data, it would have to be something we add going forward. Possibly just an `acceptedBy` field.\n\nNo promises or ETA, but marking this as tracked and adding it our backlog.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
